### Neoकर्म Backend API Tests
### Use VS Code REST Client extension to run these requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ===== HEALTH CHECK =====
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### ===== AUTHENTICATION =====

### Register New Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "grade": 10,
  "locationType": "urban",
  "schoolName": "ABC International School",
  "extraProfile": {
    "questionKey": "internetUsageHours",
    "value": 5
  }
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ===== PROFILE (requires token) =====

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Update Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aarav Sharma Updated",
  "schoolName": "New School",
  "extraProfile": {
    "questionKey": "internetUsageHours",
    "value": 7
  }
}

### ===== DAILY LOG (requires token) =====

### Submit Daily Log
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/daily-log
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transportationMode": "bus",
  "transportationDistanceKm": 15,
  "foodMealType": "vegetarian",
  "wasteAndPlasticCount": 2,
  "energyUsageHours": 3,
  "extraAnswer": {
    "questionKey": "internetUsageHours",
    "value": 4
  }
}

### Check Today's Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/daily-log/today
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Log History (Last 30 Days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/daily-log/history
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Log History (Date Range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/daily-log/history?from=2024-01-01&to=2024-12-31
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== DASHBOARD (requires token) =====

### Get Dashboard Summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== CARBON MIRROR (requires token) =====

### Get Carbon Mirror (Today + Month + Comparison)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/carbon-mirror
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Calculate What-If Scenario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/carbon-mirror/what-if
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalTotalKg": 5.5,
  "hypotheticalInputs": {
    "transportationMode": "bus",
    "transportationDistanceKm": 10,
    "foodMealType": "vegan",
    "wasteAndPlasticCount": 1,
    "energyUsageHours": 2
  }
}

### ===== MITIGATION PLAN (requires token) =====

### Get Active Mitigation Plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mitigation-plan
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Manually Generate Plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/mitigation-plan/generate
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Get Plan History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/mitigation-plan/history
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== STREAK (requires token) =====

### Get Current Streak
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/streak
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== EMISSION FACTORS (requires token, read-only) =====

### Get All Active Emission Factors
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/emission-factors
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### ===== PLACEHOLDER ENDPOINTS =====

### PDF Export (Not Implemented - 501)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pdf/export
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "ObjectId",
  "format": "pdf"
}
